    "show_share": true,
    "description": "At Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC), we applaud outstanding leadership that shapes our community and beyond. This year, Dr. Charlotte Whiting and Dr. Philip Wood stand out for their remarkable contributions, earning AKU-ISMC's 2024 Founder's Day Distinguished Leadership Awards.",
